   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tarshish Meres and Marsena",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Memucan the seven men",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holding the highest ranks again",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Memucan spoke before the throne",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The queen has wronged the king alone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But all the officials and the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will see her refusal in the hand",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The women will despise their men",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And speak the words of her again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So let the decree be written out",
   "heard": 7,
